Z||000018||Butter||11-13-2001||04:23 PM||||Yes, Welcome Back.<BR>While you were gone from this country somebody bushwhacked us with planes in New York and at that five sided headquarters house of yours.  Some civilians thwarted another attempted attack and that plane and all folks aboard went down in Pennsylvania.  The place just ain't been the same since you left.  I am So glad you have returned.  We been trying to keep things together as best we can but we may need the help of your people to do it right.  Some folks have sent tainted mail to Uncle Sam and it had a bad message in it.  We all didn’t believe that message and started searching for anyone who did so we could set them straight.  Your Commander and my President sent some of you folks abroad to look for those who would attack US and I feel better now cause I know you are the best at what you chose to do.  I hope they all get to come home too so they can enjoy what you been standing up for.  Please take a look around and enjoy the tastes of Freedom so you will know your job is right for US all.  <BR>Yes, Welcome Back and Thank You.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Butter (edited 11-13-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000019||JSocha||11-13-2001||05:17 PM||||Butter, thats some of the best "cheerleading" that I have seen in a long time.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>Ummm??? You have something brown on the end of your nose.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> j/k! Man! j/k! hehehehe||||reg||14
