Z||000026||2xsess||11-14-2001||09:42 AM||||Joel, Steve had it. I'd love to see it again too.<P>Terry, I'm looking forward to hearing from you.<BR>It's good to be back in the US, No the women over there weren't hairy...of course I didn't really look at their underarms or anything.lol<BR>Thanks for taking care of things while I was gone there Butter  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>While we were getting off the plane in Ireland..the people in the airport started applauding us as we walked through the airport. It was such an awesome feeling to know that the people in another country feel that way. And getting in to Bangor,Maine and seeing the armed soldiers in the airport there was a little wierd. One of the other guys made a comment along the lines that we were in more danger here than we had ever been in Kosovo.<P>Later,<BR>Jeff||||reg||1
